This is a compatibility branch for Ubuntu pyqt5 5.15.11+dfsg-6.

Canonical packaging: https://salsa.debian.org/python-team/packages/pyqt5.git
Base: debian/5.15.11+dfsg-6. The additional Python 3.15 changes from Debian
5.15.11+dfsg-7 are backported with their original authorship.

The additional quilt patch keeps the D-Bus helper enabled and selects the full
Python C API on a free-threaded interpreter. It preserves the normal limited
API build and does not mark the hand-written module as GIL-independent.
debian/tests/dbus-abi covers the generated buildable for both configurations.

Generated bindings also require the generic SIP legacy-ABI correction from the
StableKite/sip branch codex/ubuntu-ft/6.16.1-2. SBI discovers that dependency by
its Debian source/version metadata. The same regression checks normal and
composite legacy bindings, retaining modern abi3t behavior in SIP itself.

SBI discovers this opt-in branch from its exact Debian source/version metadata.
The branch is rolling; no dependency commit is pinned in SBI.
